<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#071321">
<meta name="description" content="Pusat Pengembangan Planet Bintang: katalog fitur Code, repositori, berkas, branch, commit, dan spesifikasi implementasi.">
<title>Pusat Pengembangan · Planet Bintang</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#071321;--panel:#0b2033;--line:#284760;--ink:#edf7ff;--muted:#a9c1d8;--cyan:#6de1ff;--lime:#d8fa42}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 0,#163e60,transparent 42%),var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1240px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(16px,3vw,36px)}a{color:var(--cyan)}.eyebrow{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--cyan)}h1{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,56px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:.3em 0}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.hero,.panel,.tile{border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(13,37,58,.95),rgba(7,21,34,.96));padding:clamp(16px,2.5vw,28px)}.hero{margin-bottom:14px}.stats,.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:14px 0}.stat{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px;background:#081a2a}.stat b{display:block;font-size:26px;color:var(--cyan)}.tile{display:block;text-decoration:none;min-height:145px}.tile:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);transform:translateY(-2px)}.tile b{font-size:17px}.tile p{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:0}.toolbar{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}.toolbar input,.toolbar select,.toolbar button{font:inherit;color:var(--ink);background:#061522;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px}.toolbar input{flex:1;min-width:210px}.list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:8px}.feature{display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#091b2b;padding:12px;text-decoration:none;min-width:0}.feature small{display:block;color:var(--muted);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.feature b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.status{font:10px ui-monospace,monospace;color:#ffd28b}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}.actions a{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:9px 12px;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:600px){.list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body><main>
<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">PLANETBINTANG · RUANG KERJA SISTEM</p><h1>Pusat Pengembangan</h1><p class="muted">Katalog Code dipindahkan dari dropdown Code ke ruang kerja tersendiri. Pilih katalog fitur untuk membuka spesifikasi dan halaman fitur individual; navigasi repositori, File Manager, branch, dan commit tetap tersedia.</p><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><b id="total">1.500</b>Spesifikasi fitur</div><div class="stat"><b id="modules">—</b>Modul terdaftar</div><div class="stat"><b>1.500</b>Halaman fitur khusus dibangun saat publikasi</div></div></section>
<section class="tiles">
<a class="tile" href="../git-feature-catalog.html"><b>Katalog Fitur Git</b><p>Telusuri fitur, filter modul dan status, lihat spesifikasi serta prompt implementasi.</p></a>
<a class="tile" href="../feature-workbench.html"><b>Ruang Kerja Implementasi</b><p>Kelola checklist, bukti kerja, dan verifikasi implementasi fitur.</p></a>
<a class="tile" href="../github-operations.html"><b>Operasi GitHub</b><p>Panel operasi repositori dan tautan tindakan provider yang tersedia.</p></a>
<a class="tile" href="https://github.com/planetbintang/.L/actions/workflows/automation-backend.yml"><b>Automation Backend</b><p>Jalankan tugas dari prompt katalog, buat berkas baru, validasi, dan simpan catatan perubahan melalui GitHub Actions.</p></a>
<a class="tile" href="../index.html#repositories"><b>Repositori</b><p>Buka indeks repositori dan metadata snapshot.</p></a>
<a class="tile" href="../index.html#fileManager"><b>File Manager</b><p>Telusuri root path dan struktur berkas yang tercakup dalam snapshot.</p></a>
<a class="tile" href="../index.html#platform/branches"><b>Branches &amp; Commits</b><p>Lihat branch dan SHA commit berdasarkan snapshot yang tersedia.</p></a>
</section>
<section class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">KATALOG FITUR INDIVIDUAL</p><h2>Semua spesifikasi</h2><p class="muted">Cari berdasarkan ID, nama fitur, modul, atau tindakan. Setiap hasil membuka halaman tersendiri yang dibangun dari data katalog resmi di repositori ini.</p>
<div class="toolbar"><input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Cari fitur, modul, ID…"><select id="module"><option value="">Semua modul</option></select><button id="prev" type="button">Sebelumnya</button><button id="next" type="button">Berikutnya</button></div><p id="summary" class="muted">Memuat katalog…</p><div id="list" class="list"></div><p id="pages" class="muted"></p></section>
<div class="actions"><a href="../index.html">Kembali ke beranda</a><a href="../README.md">Dokumentasi sistem</a></div>
<script>
(()=>{'use strict';const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));let all=[],filtered=[],page=0;const size=24;fetch('../data/git-feature-catalog.json').then(r=>{if(!r.ok)throw Error('HTTP '+r.status);return r.json()}).then(d=>{all=d.features||[];const modules=[...new Set(all.map(x=>x.module))];$('total').textContent=all.length.toLocaleString('id-ID');$('modules').textContent=modules.length.toLocaleString('id-ID');modules.forEach(m=>{const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=m;o.textContent=m;$('module').append(o)});draw()}).catch(()=>{$('summary').textContent='Katalog gagal dimuat. Periksa data/git-feature-catalog.json.'});function draw(){const q=$('q').value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase('id'),m=$('module').value;filtered=all.filter(f=>(!m||f.module===m)&&(!q||[f.id,f.title,f.module,f.action].some(v=>String(v).toLocaleLowerCase('id').includes(q))));const pages=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(filtered.length/size));page=Math.max(0,Math.min(page,pages-1));$('list').innerHTML=filtered.slice(page*size,(page+1)*size).map(f=>'<a class="feature" href="./fitur/'+encodeURIComponent(f.id)+'.html"><b>'+esc(f.title)+'</b><small>'+esc(f.id)+' · '+esc(f.module)+'</small><small class="status">'+esc(f.status||'planned')+'</small></a>').join('')||'<p>Tidak ada fitur yang cocok.</p>';$('summary').textContent=filtered.length.toLocaleString('id-ID')+' fitur ditemukan';$('pages').textContent='Halaman '+(page+1)+' / '+pages;$('prev').disabled=page===0;$('next').disabled=page>=pages-1}$('q').addEventListener('input',()=>{page=0;draw()});$('module').addEventListener('change',()=>{page=0;draw()});$('prev').addEventListener('click',()=>{page--;draw()});$('next').addEventListener('click',()=>{page++;draw()})})();
</script></main></body></html>